<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Dec 5 to 11:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 57.48</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 61.22</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 62.94</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 66.10</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$161.27</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$120.96</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 85.26</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 21.60</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.16</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 23.90</p>
</text>
